        <svg viewBox="0 0 380 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <circle cx="190" cy="190" r="170" fill="#DCE7F5"/>
          <circle cx="190" cy="190" r="128" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.6"/>
          <g transform="translate(90,90)">
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="200" height="200" rx="26" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#DCE7F5" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="100" cy="70" r="34" fill="#1B3B6F"/>
            <path d="M84 70 h32 M100 54 v32" stroke="white" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <rect x="30" y="126" width="140" height="12" rx="6" fill="#DCE7F5"/>
            <rect x="30" y="150" width="96" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="#EAF1FA"/>
            <rect x="30" y="170" width="120" height="9" rx="4.5" fill="#EAF1FA"/>
            <circle cx="170" cy="20" r="14" fill="#E8934A"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="story-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
        <h2>Built by lab scientists who wanted results people could actually understand</h2>
        <p>BioLab Diagnostics started in a single collection room in Sétif with one belief: a lab report shouldn't feel like a wall of numbers. It should feel like an answer.</p>
        <p>Today our accredited laboratories process thousands of samples every month, but the goal hasn't changed — accurate results, delivered fast, explained clearly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ANIMATED COUNTERS -->
  <section class="counters-strip">
    <div class="wrap counters-grid">
      <div class="counter"><div class="num" data-target="12" data-suffix="">0</div><div class="lbl">Years of experience</div></div>
      <div class="counter"><div class="num" data-target="40" data-suffix="+">0</div><div class="lbl">Test panels offered</div></div>
      <div class="counter"><div class="num" data-target="98" data-suffix="%">0</div><div class="lbl">Accuracy rate</div></div>
      <div class="counter"><div class="num" data-target="120000" data-suffix="+">0</div><div class="lbl">Samples analyzed</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MISSION / VISION / VALUES TABS -->
  <section class="tabs-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head center">
        <span class="eyebrow">what drives us</span>
        <h2>Mission, vision &amp; values</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-buttons">
        <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="mission">Mission</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="vision">Vision</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="values">Values</button>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-panels">
        <div class="tab-panel active" id="tab-mission">
          <span class="tag">MISSION</span>
          <h3>Turn every sample into a clear, trustworthy answer</h3>
          <p>We exist to give patients and doctors fast, accurate diagnostic results — paired with plain explanations, not just numbers on a page.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-vision">
          <span class="tag">VISION</span>
          <h3>A region where quality lab care is never out of reach</h3>
          <p>We're expanding accredited collection points across the region so precise diagnostics are close to home, not hours away.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-panel" id="tab-values">
          <span class="tag">VALUES</span>
          <h3>Precision, transparency, and genuine care</h3>
          <p>Every process is validated twice. Every result is explained, not just delivered. Every patient is treated like a person, not a sample number.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TIMELINE -->
  <section class="timeline-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head center">
        <span class="eyebrow">our journey</span>
        <h2>Milestones along the way</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-dot">1</div>
          <span class="tl-year">2014</span>
          <h4>First collection room opens in Sétif</h4>
          <p>BioLab starts with a single room, three technicians, and a promise of same-week results.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-dot">2</div>
          <span class="tl-year">2018</span>
          <h4>Accreditation &amp; new molecular unit</h4>
          <p>Our lab earns national accreditation and adds a dedicated molecular biology and genetics unit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-dot">3</div>
          <span class="tl-year">2021</span>
          <h4>Online reports &amp; home collection launch</h4>
          <p>Patients gain secure online access to results, plus the option to book a home sample collection.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-dot">4</div>
          <span class="tl-year">2026</span>
          <h4>12 centers across the region</h4>
          <p>BioLab now runs 12 collection centers, processing over 120,000 samples analyzed to date.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TEAM (flip cards) -->
