      </div>
      <div class="team-grid">
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-card-inner">
            <div class="team-face team-front">
              <div class="avatar">حس</div>
              <h4>Dr. Housam Zerrouki</h4>
              <div class="role">Lab Director, Hematology</div>
            </div>
            <div class="team-face team-back">
              <p>15 years leading hematology labs, focused on fast and accurate blood panel analysis.</p>
              <span class="spec">HEMATOLOGY</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-card-inner">
            <div class="team-face team-front">
              <div class="avatar">إي</div>
              <h4>Dr. Iman Kacimi</h4>
              <div class="role">Head of Genetics</div>
            </div>
            <div class="team-face team-back">
              <p>Leads our molecular biology unit, specializing in genetic and hereditary risk testing.</p>
              <span class="spec">GENETICS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="team-card">
          <div class="team-card-inner">
            <div class="team-face team-front">
              <div class="avatar">وليد</div>
              <h4>Walid Hammoudi</h4>
              <div class="role">Quality Control Lead</div>
            </div>
            <div class="team-face team-back">
              <p>Oversees every sample's quality checks, keeping our 98% accuracy rate consistent.</p>
